/**
 * Contact page — redesigned to match the reference carpient.com storefront:
 * full-bleed banner, a centered reading-width column with intro copy, a
 * "Send a message" form (Name + Email on one row, then Phone, Message) and a
 * "Need help?" block with the customer-service email. Keeps the stock
